      "statement": "The root pnpm scripts define five test entrypoints — test:go (go test ./...), test:ts (protocol package), test:mobile, test:conformance (builds the protocol package and runs node --test test/conformance.test.mjs), and test:install — and `pnpm test` chains them in that order.",
